-- title:
--   Uniform energy of residual normalized polynomials
-- statement:
--   Let $W$ be smooth with support in $[a_o,b_o]$, $0<a_o\le b_o$, $\Phi$ Schwartz with $\operatorname{Re}\Phi\ge0$ and $\Phi=1$ on $[0,1]$, and reals $\mathrm{cap}\ge0$, `gap`, $\varepsilon,\pi,\eta,\tau$, `loss` positive with $\eta\le1$, $\eta,\tau\le\mathrm{gap}/50$, $K\in\mathbb N$. Then there is a degree such that for every $q\ne0$ there are $C>0$, $Z_0>1$ such that for all $Z\ge Z_0$, slot data as in the finite physical bound (with ideal lists $L_i$, now of prime ideals, coefficients bounded by 1 and nonzero only where `slotRatio Z z i P` $\in[1,2]$), every ideal character $\chi$ with `elementCharacter χ` bounded by 1 and factoring modulo `fixedBaseConductor q` and $\chi$ vanishing off the complement of `reflectionExcludedPrimes q`, reals $D,m,r$ with the same constraints, finite `rows` with $\|\texttt{eisEmbedding}\,u\|^2\le Z^m$, an `Admissible` ideal $j$ generated by `assignedElement` with $N(j)/Z^{c_s}\in[1,2^K]$, every surviving product $j\cdot$`survivingProduct` `Admissible`, its chosen primes pairwise coprime and outside the excluded primes, and every $\theta$:
--   $$\sum_{u\in\mathrm{rows}}\Big\|\sum_t\prod_i\mathrm{coeff}_i(t_i)\,\texttt{residualNormalizedPolynomial}(\texttt{originalSource}\,Z\,r\,b_o,\ j\cdot\texttt{survivingProduct}\,t,\ j,\chi,1,\texttt{childLogTest}\,W\,\theta,Z,r,c_a,c_s,u)\Big\|^2\le C\,Z^{m+15\eta+\pi+\varepsilon+\mathrm{loss}}(1+|\theta|)^{2\,\mathrm{degree}}.$$
--
